o cards to come, increasing variance\n\nCalling 500 keeps the pot manageable and lets me see if the Turn improves my situation or gives more information about opponent's hand. If a safe card comes (2, 4, 5, 6, 8, 9 non-diamond), I can reassess. If a King, 10, or third diamond comes, I can easily fold to further aggression.\n\nRaising or going all-in with 7s on this board would be too aggressive given my tournament position and hand strength.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
